actualminheight=\"50px\" actualminwidth=\"0px\" actualwidth=\"720px\" class=\"module-wrap\" data-atomgroup=\"module\" data-icon=\"gpicon-liquid\" data-id=\"1679588614375\" data-key=\"liquid\" data-label=\"Liquid\" data-name=\"First Mailing Date\" data-ver=\"1.1\" id=\"m-1679588614375\" style=\"\" windowheight=\"1209\"><div class=\"module gf_module- gf_module--lg gf_module--md gf_module--sm gf_module--xs\"><div class=\"module gf_module- gf_module--lg gf_module--md gf_module--sm gf_module--xs\"><div class=\"shopify-section\" id=\"shopify-section-mailing-and-cuttoff-dates\"><select id=\"email_date\" name=\"email_date\" required=\"\">\n<\/select>\n\n<\/div><div class=\"row MailingDateSelect\" style=\"display: none\"><div class=\"col\"><div class=\"form-group\"><div class=\"select-box\"><\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"col\"> <\/div><\/div><div class=\"mail-date-custom\"><div class=\"date-inner\"><ul class=\"mailing-schedule-ul\"><li class=\"mailing-schedule-li\"><strong>Letter #1:<\/strong> Ships in 1 - 3 business days via USPS with tracking. Delivery takes 2-5 business days after shipping (5-8 business days total).<\/li><li class=\"mailing-schedule-li\"><strong>Letter #2:<\/strong> Sent via regular mail the following Friday <span id=\"custom-second-date\"><\/span>. Delivery can take up to 2 weeks for US orders or 6 weeks for international orders. Tracking not available.<\/li><li class=\"mailing-schedule-li\"><strong>Remaining Letters:<\/strong> Mailed following the schedule outlined above. Delivery can take up to 2 weeks from the mailing date for US orders or up to 6 weeks for international orders.<\/li><\/ul><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div actualheight=\"41.5px\" actualmaxheight=\"none\" actualmaxwidth=\"none\" actualminheight=\"5px\" actualminwidth=\"0px\" actualwidth=\"720px\" class=\"element-wrap\" data-atomgroup=\"element\" data-icon=\"gpicon-gpicon-button\" data-id=\"1679589314678\" data-key=\"button\" data-label=\"Button\" data-ver=\"1.0\" id=\"e-1679589314678\" style=\"\" windowheight=\"1209\"><div actualheight=\"41.5px\" actualmaxheight=\"none\" actualmaxwidth=\"none\" actualminheight=\"0px\" actualminwidth=\"0px\" actualwidth=\"720px\" class=\"elm gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs\" data-stretch-lg=\"0\" windowheight=\"1209\"><a actualheight=\"41.5px\" actualmaxheight=\"none\" actualmaxwidth=\"none\" actualminheight=\"0px\" actualminwidth=\"0px\" actualwidth=\"139.141px\" aria-describedby=\"a11y-external-message\" class=\"button btn gf_button gf_gs-button-element gf_gs-button---large\" data-exc=\"\" data-scroll-speed=\"2000\" href=\"https:\/\/theflowerletters.com\/\" target=\"\" windowheight=\"1209\"><span>SHOP STORIES<\/span><\/a><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><!--gfsplit--><div actualheight=\"726px\" actualmaxheight=\"none\" actualmaxwidth=\"none\" actualminheight=\"0px\" actualminwidth=\"0px\" actualwidth=\"1596px\" class=\"gf_row gf_row-fluid gf_row-no-padding\" data-atomgroup=\"row\" data-extraclass=\"\" data-icon=\"gpicon-row\" data-id=\"1679588434730\" data-key=\"row\" data-label=\"Row\" id=\"r-1679588434730\" viewportheight=\"60vh\" windowheight=\"1209\"><div actualheight=\"688px\" actualmaxheight=\"none\" actualmaxwidth=\"none\" actualminheight=\"1px\" actualminwidth=\"0px\" actualwidth=\"1596px\" class=\"gf_column gf_col-lg-12 gf_col-md-12 gf_col-sm-12 gf_col-xs-12\" data-id=\"1679588434637\" id=\"c-1679588434637\" viewportheight=\"63vh\" windowheight=\"1209\"><div actualheight=\"688px\" actualmaxheight=\"none\" actualmaxwidth=\"950px\" actualminheight=\"0px\" actualminwidth=\"0px\" actualwidth=\"950px\" class=\"gf_row\" data-atomgroup=\"row\" data-extraclass=\"\" data-icon=\"gpicon-row\" data-id=\"1679588490997\" data-key=\"row\" data-label=\"Row\" id=\"r-1679588490997\" viewportheight=\"63vh\" windowheight=\"1209\"><div actualheight=\"648px\" actualmaxheight=\"none\" actualmaxwidth=\"none\" actualminheight=\"1px\" actualminwidth=\"0px\" actualwidth=\"950px\" class=\"gf_column gf_col-lg-12 gf_col-md-12 gf_col-sm-12 gf_col-xs-12\" data-id=\"1679588490977\" id=\"c-1679588490977\" windowheight=\"1209\"><div actualheight=\"48px\" actualmaxheight=\"none\" actualmaxwidth=\"none\" actualminheight=\"5px\" actualminwidth=\"0px\" actualwidth=\"920px\" class=\"element-wrap\" data-atomgroup=\"element\" data-icon=\"gpicon-heading\" data-id=\"1679588438997\" data-key=\"heading\" data-label=\"Heading\" data-ver=\"2\" id=\"e-1679588438997\" style=\"\" windowheight=\"1209\"><div actualheight=\"48px\" actualmaxheight=\"none\" actualmaxwidth=\"none\" actualminheight=\"0px\" actualminwidth=\"0px\" actualwidth=\"920px\" class=\"elm text-edit gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs\" data-exc=\"\" data-gemlang=\"en\" windowheight=\"1209\"><h1 actualheight=\"48px\" actualmaxheight=\"none\" actualmaxwidth=\"none\" actualminheight=\"0px\" actualminwidth=\"0px\" actualwidth=\"920px\" class=\"gf_gs-text-heading-2\" windowheight=\"1209\">mailing fAQ<\/h1><\/div><\/div><div actualheight=\"600px\" actualmaxheight=\"none\" actualmaxwidth=\"none\" actualminheight=\"5px\" actualminwidth=\"0px\" actualwidth=\"920px\" class=\"element-wrap\" data-atomgroup=\"element\" data-icon=\"gpicon-textblock\" data-id=\"1679588469801\" data-key=\"text-block\" data-label=\"Text Block\" data-ver=\"1\" id=\"e-1679588469801\" style=\"\" windowheight=\"1209\"><grammarly-extension class=\"dnXmp\" data-grammarly-shadow-root=\"true\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 0px; left: 0px; pointer-events: none; --rem: 16;\"><\/grammarly-extension><grammarly-extension class=\"dnXmp\" data-grammarly-shadow-root=\"true\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 0px; left: 0px; pointer-events: none; --rem: 16;\"><\/grammarly-extension><div actualheight=\"600px\" actualmaxheight=\"none\" actualmaxwidth=\"none\" actualminheight=\"0px\" actualminwidth=\"0px\" actualwidth=\"920px\" class=\"elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 gf-elm-left-md gf-elm-left-sm gf-elm-left-xs gf-elm-left-lg\" data-exc=\"\" data-gemlang=\"en\" spellcheck=\"false\" windowheight=\"1209\"><div><strong>How does the new delivery of first letters and tins work?<\/strong><\/div><p><u>Letters Only:<br><\/u>The first letter will be shipped via USPS Ground with tracking and will be enclosed in a kraft cardboard envelope. It will be shipped on the selected shipping date or within three business days from purchase, with an estimated delivery time of 2–5 days after shipment within the US (total transit time: 5–8 days). International orders have an estimated delivery time of 2-4 weeks after shipment. A tracking number will be provided once the letter has been shipped.<\/p><p><br>The first letter will have the story title printed on the envelope (e.g., <em>The Audrey Rose Story<\/em>), while all subsequent letters will display the recipient's name.<\/p><p><br>Please note that the remaining letters will be sent via regular mail and will not include tracking information.<\/p><p><br><\/p><p><u>Tin + Letters:<br><\/u>The first letter will be included inside the tin, and shipped via USPS Ground with tracking. It will be shipped within three business days, with an estimated delivery time of 2–5 days after shipment within the US (total transit time: 5–8 days). International orders have an estimated delivery time of 2-4 weeks after shipment. A tracking number will be provided once the letter has been shipped.<\/p><p><br>The first letter will have the story title printed on the envelope (e.g., <em>The Audrey Rose Story<\/em>), while all subsequent letters will display the recipient's name instead.<\/p><p><br>Please note that the remaining letters will be sent via regular mail and will not include tracking information.<\/p><p><br><\/p><p><strong>How do I change the address of my order?<\/strong><br>Please reach out to support@theflowerletters.com within three business days of placing the order, and we will be able to send the first letter via USPS Ground with tracking. If the notification is made after this period, the first letter would have already been sent to the former address, so we will resend another letter via First-Class Mail.<\/p><p><br><\/p><p><strong>What happens if I don't receive my first letter?<\/strong><br>Please reach out to support@theflowerletters.com. Another first letter will be resent First-Class mail within three business days and is expected to be delivered within approximately two weeks for U.S. orders and six weeks for international orders.<\/p><p><br><\/p><p><strong>Will all the letters be sent with tracking?<\/strong><br>No, only the first letter will be shipped via USPS Ground with tracking. The remaining letters will be sent via regular mail, and therefore, tracking will not be available for those letters.<\/p><p><br><\/p><p><strong>What will be the schedule of the remaining letters?<\/strong><br>The remaining letters are generally mailed on the 2nd and 4th Fridays of each month and are expected to be delivered within approximately two weeks for U.S. orders and six weeks for international orders.<\/p><p><br><\/p><p><strong>Will this be available for international customers?<\/strong><br>Yes! The first letter or first letter + tin will be shipped to our international customers within three business days, and have an estimated delivery time of 2-6 weeks after shipment. A tracking number will be provided once the letter has been shipped.<\/p><p><br><\/p><p><strong>Will my name be on the envelopes?<\/strong><br>The first letter will have the story title printed on the envelope (e.g., <em>The Audrey Rose Story<\/em>), while all subsequent letters will display the recipient's name.<\/p><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><grammarly-extension-vbars class=\"dnXmp\" data-grammarly-shadow-root=\"true\" style=\"display: contents; --rem: 16;\"><\/grammarly-extension-vbars><\/div><\/div><!--gfsplit--><\/div><div id=\"divContentBk\"><\/div><!--End_Gem_Page_Main_Editor-->\n<!--GEM_FOOTER-->\n<!--GEM_FOOTER_END-->",
